                            AWS
                    Amazon Web Service

--> AWS stands for Amazon Web Service. It is a cloud computing platform that offers IT resources and services over the Internet 

**Region and Availability Zone(AZ):
-->A region is a seperate geographical area around the word where AWS has its data center.
eg: ap-south-1, us-east-2 etc

--> An AZ is one or more physicallly seperated data centers  within an AWS region.
--> each region contains multiple AZs.
--> each AZ has independant infrastructure, power and networking
